Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.10,0:00:43.02,name,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0030,0035)}{\frz1.378\pos(544,460)}A{\fntangak}lchemistry
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.52,1:11:49.52,name,,0,0,0,,{\fad(111,111)}{\pos(792,526)}D{\fs55}y{\fs}w
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.10,0:00:43.02,name,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0030, 0035)}{\pos(792,526)}D{\fs55}y{\fs}w
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.14,0:02:52.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Project coordinator and editor: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.14,0:02:57.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Coordinator assistants:{\c&HFFF4C5&} Martini, gaarysn
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.14,0:03:02.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Typesetter translators:{\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee, tommo, Zero Amamiya
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.24,0:00:47.66,general text,,0,0,0,,This is some kind of madness!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.74,0:00:51.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Is killing and reviving a person such entertainment?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.12,0:00:53.00,general text,,0,0,0,,We cannot interfere,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.08,0:00:55.79,general text,,0,0,0,,because Moo Dok foolishly agreed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.09,0:00:58.30,general text,,0,0,0,,This girl
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.76,0:01:02.05,general text,,0,0,0,,smiled
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.13,0:01:04.68,memories,,0,0,0,,Okay. I agree
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.60,0:01:11.39,general text,,0,0,0,,She agreed
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.48,0:01:14.31,general text,,0,0,0,,because of the gold that he will receive
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.90,0:01:17.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Is it really because of gold
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.53,0:01:21.61,general text,,0,0,0,,was she smiling?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.71,0:01:35.96,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t like it either
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.04,0:01:39.30,general text,,0,0,0,,So I will kill you painlessly
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.38,0:01:41.80,general text,,0,0,0,,This is not to show my death
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.88,0:01:45.05,general text,,0,0,0,,We are doing this to show how I will be resurrected
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.30,0:01:51.64,general text,,0,0,0,,With the help of the book they are trying to buy time to expose you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.22,0:01:54.73,italics,,0,0,0,,When she dies, they will call on the power of the stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.81,0:01:58.44,italics,,0,0,0,,use this time to move into her body
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.52,0:02:02.19,general text,,0,0,0,,The council will end when the queen dies
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.11,0:02:07.03,general text,,0,0,0,,And we will calmly leave the Pine Forest with a stone
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.78,0:02:13.37,general text,,0,0,0,,I wonder why His Majesty chose her out of everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.45,0:02:16.25,general text,,0,0,0,,She is the weakest among us
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.33,0:02:17.96,italics,,0,0,0,,He made the right choice
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.11,0:03:27.32,memories,,0,0,0,,My beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.57,0:03:30.36,memories,,0,0,0,,My Boo Young
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.21,0:03:40.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Mother
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.49,0:04:12.87,general text,,0,0,0,,No one is looking at you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.95,0:04:14.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Move your soul
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.53,0:04:17.08,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s not me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.16,0:04:20.00,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t control the stone
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.58,0:04:21.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Then who?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.34,0:05:09.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Stop this
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.39,0:05:23.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Mother, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.02,0:05:29.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Bu Young...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.15,0:05:35.70,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Did she recognize her? This is bad
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.28,0:05:38.20,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,She will come to life now
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.78,0:05:40.12,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,This cannot be allowed
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.20,0:05:41.54,voiceover,,0,0,0,,She must die
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.08,0:06:28.33,general text,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.83,0:06:30.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Where is the stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.46,0:06:35.59,general text,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.31,0:06:49.56,italics,,0,0,0,,Have you seen it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.65,0:06:52.82,general text,,0,0,0,,The powers of stone and heaven have united
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.90,0:06:55.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Apparently the heavens took the stone
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.07,0:06:58.61,general text,,0,0,0,,The stone was not taken
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.29,0:07:04.45,general text,,0,0,0,,He's still
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.41,0:07:06.50,general text,,0,0,0,,somewhere here
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.58,0:07:10.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Where is it exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.03,0:07:40.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Thunder, lightning, now also fog in the middle of the day?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.32,0:07:41.95,general text,,0,0,0,,That's not all
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.03,0:07:43.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Something went wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.71,0:07:53.34,general text,,0,0,0,,- Was this what they used to cover the stone?\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.42,0:07:54.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Something happened to the stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.00,0:07:57.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Is this a dream or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.55,0:08:00.63,general text,,0,0,0,,- Flowers everywhere\N - Everything is somehow unreal
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.34,0:08:03.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Are we dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.97,0:08:06.43,general text,,0,0,0,,- Is this the afterlife?\N- Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.52,0:08:08.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Stop talking nonsense
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.23,0:08:11.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Then I am the jade emperor, and he is a fairy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.94,0:08:14.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Fairy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.32,0:08:25.62,general text,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.49,0:08:27.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Definitely not a fairy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.83,0:08:30.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.13,0:08:41.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you magicians?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.38,0:08:44.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, the magicians of Jeonjingak
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.64,0:08:50.02,general text,,0,0,0,,You are here too, Ms. Ho
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.31,0:08:55.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Let me go
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.53,0:09:01.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook, don’t go anywhere, guard this place
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.49,0:09:03.82,general text,,0,0,0,,You three
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.61,0:09:05.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Look around the area
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.70,0:09:09.37,general text,,0,0,0,,- I'm going to the training room\N- We will accompany you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.12,0:09:13.87,general text,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.96,0:09:15.21,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard thunder
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.29,0:09:17.42,general text,,0,0,0,,We don’t know either
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.21,0:09:21.21,general text,,0,0,0,,We'll find out when the fog clears
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.88,0:09:23.63,general text,,0,0,0,,If this is not a dream or an afterlife,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.22,0:09:26.09,general text,,0,0,0,,where do all these flowers come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.18,0:09:28.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Is the fog real?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.72,0:10:06.18,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.26,0:10:07.18,general text,,0,0,0,,You didn’t understand
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.26,0:10:10.72,general text,,0,0,0,,We tried to go out the gate, but a gust of wind threw us back
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.81,0:10:11.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Wind?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.31,0:10:14.56,general text,,0,0,0,,There is no wind
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.23,0:10:20.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t approach. We don't see
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.57,0:10:22.44,general text,,0,0,0,,but incredible energy surrounds us
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.53,0:10:24.78,general text,,0,0,0,,What is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.86,0:10:25.82,general text,,0,0,0,,This is a barrier
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.24,0:10:29.95,general text,,0,0,0,,I think there is a barrier around Jeongjingak
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.95,0:10:32.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Barrier?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.12,0:10:33.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Who built it here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.70,0:10:34.87,italics,,0,0,0,,Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.08,0:10:38.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.42,0:10:40.71,general text,,0,0,0,,The heiress of Jinyeowon is here
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.46,0:10:43.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Bu Young, who brought the ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.88,0:10:45.55,general text,,0,0,0,,fainted
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.89,0:10:57.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.12,0:11:17.79,general text,,0,0,0,,The energy of the stone penetrated Jeonjingak
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.87,0:11:19.88,general text,,0,0,0,,and created a barrier
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.33,0:11:23.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Who's inside now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.67,0:11:26.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook and Seo Yul are nowhere to be found
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.67,0:11:27.97,general text,,0,0,0,,They are most likely there
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.93,0:11:30.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Miss Ho is there too
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.59,0:11:33.10,general text,,0,0,0,,- My Young Ok!\N-{\i1} Crown Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.18,0:11:34.72,general text,,0,0,0,,His Highness is there too
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.47,0:11:38.94,general text,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- Is Bom there too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.02,0:11:41.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Where is Jin Ho?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.11,0:11:43.11,italics,,0,0,0,,Chief Jin,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.19,0:11:44.40,general text,,0,0,0,,do something
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.48,0:11:47.69,general text,,0,0,0,,The stone swallowed your daughter too, she’s probably there too
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.32,0:11:50.32,general text,,0,0,0,,You can’t rush
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.41,0:11:53.78,general text,,0,0,0,,We saw what happened after Jin Bu Young's intervention
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.08,0:11:57.83,general text,,0,0,0,,It's Jinyeowon's fault
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.29,0:12:01.83,general text,,0,0,0,,You wanted to see the power of the ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.92,0:12:03.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Now you want to blame us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.75,0:12:07.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you going to quarrel again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.38,0:12:10.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Enough already. The kids are there
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.13,0:12:11.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Yong Ok!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.90,0:12:31.15,general text,,0,0,0,,You can do something
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.24,0:12:33.99,general text,,0,0,0,,with a barrier around Jeonjingak?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.07,0:12:35.87,general text,,0,0,0,,What happened in the training hall?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.16,0:12:38.20,general text,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.96,0:12:50.30,voiceover,,0,0,0,,This is definitely because of Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.38,0:12:53.76,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Still, she is the real Jin Bu Young from Jinyoung
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.34,0:12:56.26,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,And everyone thinks it’s me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.35,0:12:58.60,offscreen,,0,0,0,,I can’t say it’s her
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.68,0:12:59.56,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.52,0:13:01.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Answer
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.94,0:13:03.19,general text,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.69,0:13:05.98,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.06,0:13:09.32,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm blind, so I didn't see what happened
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.40,0:13:12.15,general text,,0,0,0,,I lost consciousness when the wind rose and just woke up
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.24,0:13:14.16,general text,,0,0,0,,You don’t know how you ended up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.24,0:13:16.70,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t even know where I am
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.78,0:13:19.58,general text,,0,0,0,,How do I know how I got here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.00,0:13:26.21,general text,,0,0,0,,She doesn’t look very good
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.25,0:13:29.92,general text,,0,0,0,,All pale, sweat on my forehead
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.01,0:13:31.59,general text,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.38,0:13:36.22,general text,,0,0,0,,She needs to rest first, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.68,0:13:40.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Let him rest
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.02,0:13:43.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.57,0:13:49.94,general text,,0,0,0,,It's all a lie
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.40,0:13:52.69,general text,,0,0,0,,What is she hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.78,0:13:54.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Perhaps Moo Dok knows
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.90,0:13:56.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok, were you with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.20,0:14:00.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, how did you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.12,0:14:04.79,general text,,0,0,0,,I was here all the time
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.92,0:14:09.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you been here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.05,0:14:12.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Didn’t you spill the tea in the study hall?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.47,0:14:16.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, but then I immediately followed you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.97,0:14:19.97,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know what happened then
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.93,0:14:23.85,general text,,0,0,0,,What can you ask a maid who only knows how
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.43,0:14:28.23,general text,,0,0,0,,run after your master like a little dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.31,0:14:29.86,italics,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.36,0:14:32.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Beyond the barrier are the best magicians of the Unified Council
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.90,0:14:35.28,general text,,0,0,0,,They will rescue us quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.45,0:14:38.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Bring His Highness tea
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.37,0:14:39.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.92,0:14:55.34,general text,,0,0,0,,A dog that runs after its owner
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.42,0:14:57.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Knowing nothing servant
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.93,0:15:00.64,general text,,0,0,0,,This is Mu Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.94,0:15:08.31,general text,,0,0,0,,That’s right
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.40,0:15:10.11,general text,,0,0,0,,And there is no water
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.79,0:16:12.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Tea boiled by a spell is the most delicious
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.50,0:16:15.80,general text,,0,0,0,,A lot of time has passed
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.51,0:16:22.97,voiceover,,0,0,0,,I finally got my strength back thanks to the stone
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.06,0:16:34.81,memories,,0,0,0,,What's going on? Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.57,0:16:38.86,memories,,0,0,0,,We won't lose this time
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.69,0:16:41.70,memories,,0,0,0,,We are in the ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.32,0:16:45.20,memories,,0,0,0,,Is this a stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.78,0:16:48.95,memories,,0,0,0,,Ice stone is not limited by size or shape
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.58,0:16:51.79,memories,,0,0,0,,It could be water, fire
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.87,0:16:53.54,memories,,0,0,0,,or the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.67,0:17:00.01,memories,,0,0,0,,So the stone is mine now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.97,0:17:09.60,memories,,0,0,0,,No one can possess the stone
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.98,0:17:13.06,memories,,0,0,0,,You can only use its power
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.14,0:17:15.77,memories,,0,0,0,,It’s like giving and taking
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.86,0:17:17.90,memories,,0,0,0,,You gain something, you lose something
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.98,0:17:20.94,memories,,0,0,0,,This is a burden you must bear
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.03,0:17:23.53,memories,,0,0,0,,I will accept it with joy
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.61,0:17:25.20,memories,,0,0,0,,Well, try it
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.28,0:17:27.33,memories,,0,0,0,,Excessive energy will lead to
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.95,0:17:30.66,memories,,0,0,0,,that you cannot control the power you use
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.45,0:17:34.00,memories,,0,0,0,,If you want rain, you will get a flood
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.83,0:17:37.54,memories,,0,0,0,,If you want wind, you will get a typhoon
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.50,0:17:39.59,memories,,0,0,0,,Try to cope
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.09,0:17:41.30,memories,,0,0,0,,What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.88,0:17:43.51,memories,,0,0,0,,Relic of Jinyoewon?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.43,0:17:46.84,memories,,0,0,0,,How dare the soul that lives in my body,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.76,0:17:49.22,memories,,0,0,0,,call me a relic?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.96,0:18:19.17,memories,,0,0,0,,Jeonjingak?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.47,0:18:26.88,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.05,0:18:31.26,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Jinyewon's relic attached to the stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.56,0:18:39.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.90,0:18:42.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Brought the prince a broken cup?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.65,0:18:44.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.44,0:18:45.53,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll change
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.07,0:18:49.41,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Stop. I don't need to serve anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.49,0:18:50.95,general text,,0,0,0,,- Mu Dok\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.53,0:18:53.95,general text,,0,0,0,,One hundred dirty. Wipe it down
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.04,0:18:56.16,offscreen,,0,0,0,,No need to obey
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.75,0:18:58.33,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Have I become Moo Deok to the core?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.13,0:19:05.76,voiceover,,0,0,0,,I'm not Moo Deok anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.84,0:19:06.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.01,0:19:14.93,general text,,0,0,0,,We haven’t eaten anything since the beginning of the council
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.02,0:19:16.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Have something to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.10,0:19:19.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Sujebi would be suitable for us*
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.10,0:19:19.73,notes,,0,0,0,,*traditional Korean soup with pieces of dough
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.81,0:19:20.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Can you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.49,0:19:29.95,general text,,0,0,0,,I Mu Dok until I finish cooking
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.66,0:19:34.29,general text,,0,0,0,,And then I will stop being her
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.37,0:19:37.71,general text,,0,0,0,,When I can resettle the soul again,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.79,0:19:40.17,general text,,0,0,0,,I will select any body
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.42,0:19:43.96,general text,,0,0,0,,I can even be a king
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.64,0:19:53.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Or it’s better to kill the enemy
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.26,0:19:55.60,general text,,0,0,0,,and take his body for yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.77,0:20:05.98,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t want
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.24,0:20:09.45,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s better to become Park Jin
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.46,0:20:21.37,general text,,0,0,0,,You can choose anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.96,0:20:23.50,general text,,0,0,0,,We need to think
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.96,0:20:26.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Perfect
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.80,0:20:29.09,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s a pity to let him go to Suzhebi*
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.80,0:20:29.09,notes,,0,0,0,,*soup dough is torn by hand
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.17,0:20:30.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should make some kuksa?*
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.17,0:20:30.76,notes,,0,0,0,,* cold noodle soup
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.84,0:20:32.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook loves kuksu
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.56,0:20:40.64,memories,,0,0,0,,The smell is so weak
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.40,0:20:51.32,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the last meal that Moo Deok prepares for the owner
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.29,0:21:02.87,general text,,0,0,0,,- Master\N- Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.25,0:21:07.04,general text,,0,0,0,,I made kuksu, eat it
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.13,0:21:08.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.05,0:21:15.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Now your maid is leaving you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.35,0:21:18.51,general text,,0,0,0,,And more...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.39,0:21:22.56,general text,,0,0,0,,here I will stop being your teacher
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.27,0:21:25.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Will you stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.02,0:21:29.07,general text,,0,0,0,,You probably didn’t understand,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.82,0:21:31.44,general text,,0,0,0,,we are inside the ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.15,0:21:34.32,general text,,0,0,0,,I regained the power like on Lake Gyeongcheongdaeho
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.95,0:21:38.79,general text,,0,0,0,,And I use this stone for alchemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.74,0:21:41.37,general text,,0,0,0,,to leave this body
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.37,0:21:44.67,general text,,0,0,0,,That is...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.71,0:21:47.38,general text,,0,0,0,,we won’t see each other again?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.46,0:21:49.34,general text,,0,0,0,,We have committed to finish everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.92,0:21:51.88,general text,,0,0,0,,when I get my power back
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.96,0:21:54.84,general text,,0,0,0,,And then they committed to discuss our future
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.85,0:22:03.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Not for us
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.52,0:22:06.77,general text,,0,0,0,,another future
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.82,0:22:17.87,memories italics,,0,0,0,,You gain something, you lose something
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.95,0:22:20.83,memories,,0,0,0,,This is a burden you must bear
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.29,0:22:24.41,general text,,0,0,0,,If I need to lose you in exchange for power,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.00,0:22:27.42,general text,,0,0,0,,so be it
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.68,0:22:41.60,general text,,0,0,0,,- Master\N- Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.68,0:22:43.77,general text,,0,0,0,,I made kuksu, eat it
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.52,0:22:46.06,general text,,0,0,0,,- And...\N- Mu Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.14,0:22:48.23,general text,,0,0,0,,I think the barrier around Jeonjingak
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.31,0:22:50.19,general text,,0,0,0,,this is an ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.77,0:22:51.61,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.23,0:22:54.69,offscreen,,0,0,0,,He shouldn't have understood that
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.20,0:22:58.49,general text,,0,0,0,,They say that stone is water, fire and wind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.03,0:23:01.03,general text,,0,0,0,,I think the power of the wind is enveloping us
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.91,0:23:04.37,italics,,0,0,0,,If we are inside a stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.91,0:23:08.25,general text,,0,0,0,,can it be taken away without anyone understanding?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.96,0:23:12.17,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.25,0:23:13.88,general text,,0,0,0,,I mastered Chisa
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.63,0:23:16.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe I can catch him like a Goldfish?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.55,0:23:19.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Your current strength cannot even be compared
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.59,0:23:20.80,general text,,0,0,0,,with ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.10,0:23:26.39,general text,,0,0,0,,I hope you can regain your strength, like you did on the lake
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.19,0:23:30.56,general text,,0,0,0,,I think you can do it
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.73,0:23:35.44,general text,,0,0,0,,If I return the power
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.11,0:23:38.28,general text,,0,0,0,,and run away with the stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.24,0:23:42.99,general text,,0,0,0,,If caught, you might be killed
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.20,0:23:45.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Aren’t you afraid?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.49,0:23:48.21,general text,,0,0,0,,The probability that you will run away with the stone
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.29,0:23:50.21,general text,,0,0,0,,has always existed
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.17,0:23:55.05,general text,,0,0,0,,And I already said that I will take full responsibility
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.09,0:24:01.18,general text,,0,0,0,,But
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.01,0:24:03.55,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm a little scared
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.93,0:24:09.39,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that you will break our promise and leave me without even saying goodbye
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.48,0:24:12.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Teacher,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.52,0:24:16.23,general text,,0,0,0,,don’t leave me, otherwise I’ll cry like crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.99,0:24:22.66,general text,,0,0,0,,You say such embarrassing things so easily
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.99,0:24:25.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Then you will regret it
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.33,0:24:31.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Saying something like this is not difficult, I can bear the embarrassment
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.33,0:24:34.92,general text,,0,0,0,,But I won’t turn back time, even if I regret something
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.59,0:24:39.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Teacher, avoid embarrassment
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.38,0:24:40.88,general text,,0,0,0,,and be honest with yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.97,0:24:43.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Then you won’t regret anything
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.73,0:24:52.02,general text,,0,0,0,,- Chan Wook, I...\N{\i1}- Mister
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.65,0:24:56.73,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll be right there
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.48,0:24:59.57,general text,,0,0,0,,She has the key to the hall with forbidden books
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.65,0:25:02.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Since we are here, I want to look for something
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.36,0:25:04.45,italics,,0,0,0,,By the way
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.29,0:25:11.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Eat it yourself. Don't share with anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.69,0:25:41.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Looking for books about dark magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.36,0:25:43.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, I heard my father left here
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.57,0:25:47.03,general text,,0,0,0,,all books about dark magic that I received from the shaman
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.83,0:25:50.33,general text,,0,0,0,,I want to find them
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.41,0:25:55.42,general text,,0,0,0,,So these are the books of Gwangju Chang Gang
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.50,0:25:57.96,general text,,0,0,0,,I will help
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.04,0:26:01.51,general text,,0,0,0,,I can handle it myself. You can leave me the key and go
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.92,0:26:05.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Grandfather entrusted it to me
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.47,0:26:07.43,general text,,0,0,0,,How can I be sure that you will not lose it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.51,0:26:11.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Well, yes. There is no faith in me. Thanks for your help
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.33,0:26:31.41,general text,,0,0,0,,So, attention
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.12,0:26:36.75,general text,,0,0,0,,There are enough free rooms and food in Jeongjingak
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.83,0:26:40.25,italics,,0,0,0,,So don’t worry too much
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.34,0:26:41.42,italics,,0,0,0,,Let's keep calm
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.50,0:26:42.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.64,0:26:54.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Go to Kisan and send everyone here
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.68,0:26:57.44,general text,,0,0,0,,We also have rights to the power of the ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.52,0:26:58.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.73,0:27:03.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Gather everyone who can cast spells
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.03,0:27:05.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Even children and old people
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.99,0:27:07.24,general text,,0,0,0,,- Yes, sir\N- Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.16,0:27:18.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Gather all the magicians of Jeonbugwan and send them to Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.37,0:27:20.92,general text,,0,0,0,,A fight may break out over the ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.42,0:27:22.92,general text,,0,0,0,,We must be prepared
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.00,0:27:24.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.97,0:27:32.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.93,0:27:34.77,general text,,0,0,0,,You look sick
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.85,0:27:36.85,general text,,0,0,0,,You should return to the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.69,0:27:40.73,general text,,0,0,0,,I have to see this with my own eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.77,0:27:43.27,general text,,0,0,0,,We saw an ice stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.36,0:27:46.28,general text,,0,0,0,,which means the King’s star is not far off
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.50,0:28:04.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Probably everyone is waiting for us to bring “Words of the Heart”
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.51,0:28:07.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.39,0:28:17.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.52,0:28:18.89,general text,,0,0,0,,We brought “Words of the Heart”
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.98,0:28:20.81,general text,,0,0,0,,No time for them now
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.90,0:28:22.69,general text,,0,0,0,,A barrier has appeared around Jeongjingak
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.27,0:28:24.40,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.32,0:28:34.12,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Am I going to get caught?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.29,0:28:38.33,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Then they will definitely kill
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.02,0:29:01.35,general text,,0,0,0,,These are honey cookies
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.19,0:29:05.06,general text,,0,0,0,,You ate almost nothing. Help yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.61,0:29:11.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.16,0:29:16.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Were you very surprised when you found out that I am the daughter of the Jin family?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.78,0:29:19.75,general text,,0,0,0,,When we first met, I didn’t know my parents yet
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.12,0:29:22.54,general text,,0,0,0,,This is your umbrella
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.17,0:29:26.42,general text,,0,0,0,,I carried it with me everywhere
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.50,0:29:28.71,general text,,0,0,0,,I hoped you would recognize me if we met again
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.01,0:29:35.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Gwangju Deputy Jin Mu helped you find your parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.22,0:29:36.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.18,0:29:42.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Please don't tell him that we've met before
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.60,0:29:46.69,general text,,0,0,0,,If mother finds out,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.77,0:29:49.40,general text,,0,0,0,,what I went through will break her heart
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.15,0:29:53.11,general text,,0,0,0,,So don't tell him
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.53,0:29:56.66,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Everyone who knew her was killed
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.24,0:29:58.66,voiceover,,0,0,0,,She spared me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.37,0:30:04.50,memories,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu has no idea that we know who she is
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.04,0:30:06.29,memories,,0,0,0,,This is his weakness
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.79,0:30:10.42,memories,,0,0,0,,He must have killed everyone to hide her identity
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.50,0:30:13.26,memories,,0,0,0,,In the end, she will die too
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.88,0:30:16.64,memories,,0,0,0,,If the queen plans to transfer the soul into her body...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.22,0:30:18.55,memories,,0,0,0,,She was brought here to kill
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.64,0:30:21.31,memories,,0,0,0,,She has no idea about anything and does everything she can
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.39,0:30:23.06,memories,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu uses her
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.27,0:30:26.23,memories,,0,0,0,,Just like Nak Soo
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.94,0:30:32.15,memories,,0,0,0,,So Yi is also just a poor girl
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.61,0:30:35.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.36,0:30:37.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.70,0:30:40.03,general text,,0,0,0,,that this umbrella doesn’t do its job?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.08,0:30:45.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Look. It's already torn
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.96,0:30:48.04,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s true
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.13,0:30:50.38,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s expensive, the seller said it’s high quality
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.46,0:30:52.25,general text,,0,0,0,,You must have been deceived
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.47,0:31:00.01,general text,,0,0,0,,I am very trusting
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.93,0:31:02.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.55,0:31:44.68,italics,,0,0,0,,Is Master Kahn missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.35,0:31:48.23,general text,,0,0,0,,He absorbed her energy and left
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.73,0:31:51.23,general text,,0,0,0,,We can’t find him Saejukwon
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.31,0:31:54.36,general text,,0,0,0,,The unified council took place next to the training halls
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.44,0:31:55.65,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s unlikely he went there
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.73,0:31:57.65,general text,,0,0,0,,There was confusion all day,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.74,0:31:59.45,general text,,0,0,0,,but we would have noticed it
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.53,0:32:02.78,general text,,0,0,0,,There is a place where he could hide
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.45,0:32:04.83,general text,,0,0,0,,and go unnoticed
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.54,0:32:09.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Inside the barrier
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.46,0:32:12.42,general text,,0,0,0,,He might be there
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.33,0:32:51.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Nomad
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.59,0:32:56.00,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm with Jin Mu
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.84,0:33:02.09,general text,,0,0,0,,I know you
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.76,0:33:04.72,general text,,0,0,0,,I saw you move your soul in Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.80,0:33:07.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Your soul has left your old body
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.82,0:33:20.99,general text,,0,0,0,,We are on the same side. Spare me
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.41,0:33:25.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Now I need human energy
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.49,0:33:27.12,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll bring someone for you
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.20,0:33:28.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Energy of the magicians of Jeonjingak
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.08,0:33:31.58,general text,,0,0,0,,will be better than mine
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.21,0:33:33.75,italics,,0,0,0,,Wait here,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.83,0:33:35.79,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll lure someone here
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.50,0:33:39.59,general text,,0,0,0,,- Magi of Jeonjingak?\N- {\i1}Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.67,0:33:41.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Because of the barrier, no one can
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.42,0:33:43.72,general text,,0,0,0,,neither leave nor enter Chongjingak
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.34,0:33:46.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Barrier?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.65,0:34:03.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Miss Jin?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.61,0:34:05.28,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.36,0:34:07.28,general text,,0,0,0,,I was looking for something,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.37,0:34:09.91,general text,,0,0,0,,but then I dropped my umbrella, I can’t walk without it
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.66,0:34:12.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Here he is
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.24,0:34:50.53,italics,,0,0,0,,I won’t kill you
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.62,0:34:53.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Bring more magicians
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.70,0:34:54.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.50,0:34:59.96,general text,,0,0,0,,So Yul...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.67,0:35:02.21,general text,,0,0,0,,also in Jeonjingak?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.88,0:35:05.80,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.30,0:35:10.93,italics,,0,0,0,,He wounded me with a sword
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.51,0:35:13.10,general text,,0,0,0,,I will kill him first
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.43,0:35:15.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Here it is
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.48,0:35:17.64,general text,,0,0,0,,no
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.11,0:35:22.48,general text,,0,0,0,,If you refuse,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.19,0:35:25.53,general text,,0,0,0,,I will kill you
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.61,0:35:26.61,general text,,0,0,0,,I will do everything
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.20,0:35:30.74,general text,,0,0,0,,There is a person I want to get rid of
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.16,0:35:33.83,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll give it
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.33,0:35:37.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Please kill her
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.89,0:35:53.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Snacks are not tasty
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.26,0:35:54.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Kuksu too
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.02,0:35:57.77,voiceover,,0,0,0,,I haven’t talked to Chan Wook yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.35,0:36:00.10,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,so I’ll stay with Moo Deok a little longer
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.15,0:36:02.69,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.94,0:36:05.86,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the chapter wine that Dan Gu hid
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.62,0:36:14.95,general text,,0,0,0,,How do you like the taste?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.24,0:36:17.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Not bad
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.37,0:36:20.04,italics,,0,0,0,,I wonder what they're doing outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.12,0:36:22.67,general text,,0,0,0,,- since this problem has not been solved yet\N{\i1}- Still,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.75,0:36:26.21,general text,,0,0,0,,there are flowers around, the weather is beautiful,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.30,0:36:28.97,general text,,0,0,0,,everything is fragrant. It's not that bad
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.13,0:36:31.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.13,0:36:32.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Admiring flowers is boring
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.97,0:36:34.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want to see the Hyonggon technique?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.56,0:36:38.14,general text,,0,0,0,,This is a pretty interesting technique
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.23,0:36:39.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.06,0:36:41.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay, show me
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.77,0:36:42.94,italics,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.86,0:37:29.90,italics,,0,0,0,,What?..
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.99,0:37:31.78,general text,,0,0,0,,- Bom!\N - Bom!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.90,0:37:34.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Bom, wake up
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.49,0:37:35.70,italics,,0,0,0,,- Come on!\N- Hey
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.78,0:37:37.91,italics,,0,0,0,,- Let's raise it\N- Bom
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.45,0:37:42.54,general text,,0,0,0,,After the spell, did your energy leave you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.62,0:37:43.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.54,0:37:45.75,general text,,0,0,0,,I felt the energy leaving me
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.83,0:37:46.92,general text,,0,0,0,,As if
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.13,0:37:50.30,general text,,0,0,0,,energy poured out like from a broken vase
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.17,0:37:52.72,general text,,0,0,0,,I checked his energy core,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.80,0:37:54.55,general text,,0,0,0,,he lost most of it
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.34,0:37:57.85,general text,,0,0,0,,How could I lose energy?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.40,0:38:09.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe it’s the sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.75,0:38:30.17,general text,,0,0,0,,My energy just came out through the sword
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.75,0:38:32.76,general text,,0,0,0,,I think the problem is in the barrier
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.80,0:38:36.76,general text,,0,0,0,,It seems that he is taking energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.97,0:38:40.51,general text,,0,0,0,,when you use spells
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.53,0:38:56.32,general text,,0,0,0,,You cannot use spells
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.40,0:38:58.03,general text,,0,0,0,,and draw swords
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.82,0:39:00.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's leave the swords here
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.13,0:39:11.63,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the sword of Nak Su. Teacher Li took it from me
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.17,0:39:13.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you have it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.38,0:39:15.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. He asked me to keep it
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.05,0:39:17.84,general text,,0,0,0,,But the maid Kim didn’t like that he was at home
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.93,0:39:19.34,general text,,0,0,0,,So I left it here
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.03,0:39:35.86,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Take this
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.94,0:39:37.61,memories,,0,0,0,,and give it to him when he returns
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.57,0:39:42.16,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t leave when I’ve been entrusted with this
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.29,0:39:44.49,italics,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.62,0:39:46.87,general text,,0,0,0,,What's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.96,0:39:49.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Did the unified council go well?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.50,0:39:50.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Hardly
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.92,0:39:54.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Mages from all families are now heading to Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.09,0:39:57.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Something must have happened
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.63,0:40:01.93,memories italics,,0,0,0,,He will have to come back because of all this turmoil
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.23,0:40:11.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Is Gwangju Chang Gang really coming back?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.09,0:40:38.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.22,0:40:42.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Gwangju
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.43,0:40:51.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Who is Deputy Jin Mu's assistant now?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.54,0:41:19.76,memories,,0,0,0,,Cho Chan threatened to reveal the truth about Young Master Chan
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.84,0:41:23.09,memories,,0,0,0,,I had no choice but to teach him the alchemy of souls
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.64,0:41:27.10,memories,,0,0,0,,He went wild and died, so it’s all over?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.93,0:41:31.27,memories italics,,0,0,0,,I did this only for you and your son
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.10,0:41:35.94,memories,,0,0,0,,Because of witchcraft, I lost my wife and a close friend
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.19,0:41:39.28,memories,,0,0,0,,I will get rid of all the remaining reflectors
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.90,0:41:42.15,memories,,0,0,0,,I will seal the ice stone in Lake Gyeongcheongdaeho
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.78,0:41:43.91,memories,,0,0,0,,Don’t...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.86,0:41:47.49,memories,,0,0,0,,You went through so much to get it...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.58,0:41:49.45,memories,,0,0,0,,How can you get rid of the stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.54,0:41:50.66,memories,,0,0,0,,You can’t do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.21,0:41:54.29,memories,,0,0,0,,You also know alchemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.13,0:41:57.96,memories,,0,0,0,,so I will destroy the core of your energy
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.04,0:41:59.46,memories,,0,0,0,,Destroy the core?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.71,0:42:02.17,memories,,0,0,0,,Don’t
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.22,0:42:12.02,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Please don't destroy it
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.10,0:42:15.27,memories,,0,0,0,,I swear to never use soul alchemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.77,0:42:19.11,memories,,0,0,0,,which you taught me. I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.58,0:42:40.84,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,It was worth destroying its core then
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.13,0:42:46.34,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Instead of hiding the ice stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.93,0:42:48.85,offscreen,,0,0,0,,I should have destroyed him too
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.18,0:42:53.89,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,How did he manage to get it
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.27,0:42:57.23,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,from Gyeongcheongdaeho Lake?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.31,0:42:59.90,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Did someone help him?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.68,0:43:33.43,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm fine
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.14,0:43:37.56,general text,,0,0,0,,But there is one difference between us
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.94,0:43:40.19,general text,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.44,0:43:43.94,general text,,0,0,0,,nomad
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.32,0:43:48.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey Bom
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.53,0:43:50.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Workouts will get you back in shape
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.49,0:43:54.16,italics,,0,0,0,,He's right, everything will be fine
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.24,0:43:55.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Cheer up
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.54,0:43:58.62,offscreen,,0,0,0,,The ice stone absorbs their energy
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.71,0:44:01.67,offscreen,,0,0,0,,If I change my body and take the stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.25,0:44:04.92,voiceover,,0,0,0,,will I take their energy too?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.63,0:44:08.01,memories italics,,0,0,0,,You gain something, you lose something
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.09,0:44:10.84,memories,,0,0,0,,This is a burden you must bear
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.89,0:44:13.72,general text,,0,0,0,,If I want my power back,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.85,0:44:18.14,general text,,0,0,0,,I will have to absorb their energy
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.44,0:44:20.35,italics,,0,0,0,,Then
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.02,0:44:22.48,general text,,0,0,0,,they will all die
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.58,0:44:35.20,general text,,0,0,0,,I will be responsible
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.16,0:44:38.04,general text,,0,0,0,,in their deaths
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.79,0:44:44.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Won Moo Deok, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.80,0:44:52.34,offscreen,,0,0,0,,He will die too
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.14,0:44:54.47,italics,,0,0,0,,It’s dangerous here
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.55,0:44:56.60,general text,,0,0,0,,If you touch the barrier,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.68,0:44:58.64,general text,,0,0,0,,you will break all your bones
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.73,0:45:00.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Move away
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.40,0:45:06.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Would you like to thank me?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.94,0:45:10.24,general text,,0,0,0,,I showed concern for you
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.28,0:45:15.33,general text,,0,0,0,,You lost energy earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.24,0:45:17.54,general text,,0,0,0,,How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.70,0:45:22.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you expressing gratitude by worrying about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.25,0:45:24.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Not bad
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.50,0:45:27.25,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm fine
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.42,0:45:29.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Forgive me
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.67,0:45:30.92,general text,,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.01,0:45:34.51,general text,,0,0,0,,For preparing terrible snacks and kuksa
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.05,0:45:36.72,general text,,0,0,0,,You couldn’t even eat
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.35,0:45:43.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Take this
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.36,0:45:49.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook's favorite cookies
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.49,0:45:52.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you sharing with me what he gave you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.95,0:45:55.45,italics,,0,0,0,,No need, keep it for yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.37,0:46:00.37,general text,,0,0,0,,I know I have to take them
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.87,0:46:05.67,general text,,0,0,0,,But I decided to give them to you. All
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.63,0:46:10.25,general text,,0,0,0,,I gave them to you
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.80,0:46:14.88,voiceover,,0,0,0,,He's not the nicest person, but he's been taking care of me all this time
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.47,0:46:19.35,italics,,0,0,0,,Take
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.43,0:46:21.56,general text,,0,0,0,,I want to sincerely thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.93,0:46:24.89,general text,,0,0,0,,- Sincerely?{\i1}\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.56,0:46:26.94,general text,,0,0,0,,From the bottom of my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.40,0:46:30.23,general text,,0,0,0,,I am always grateful to you
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.65,0:46:37.28,general text,,0,0,0,,If you want to thank me sincerely,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.12,0:46:41.33,general text,,0,0,0,,give me something more
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.79,0:46:44.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Something more significant
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.63,0:46:52.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Just accept it
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.42,0:46:56.34,general text,,0,0,0,,This is what you need
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.22,0:47:02.14,general text,,0,0,0,,You are incredible
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.18,0:47:07.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Always dare and achieve your goal
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.73,0:47:10.52,italics,,0,0,0,,But every time I reach out to you, you retreat
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.65,0:47:16.45,general text,,0,0,0,,The reason I'm not trying to hold you back is,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.11,0:47:19.49,general text,,0,0,0,,what if in the end you still refuse me, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.79,0:47:27.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Forget it, I won’t accept your gratitude in such quantity
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.01,0:47:43.77,general text,,0,0,0,,I would feel less terrible if he accepted it
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.77,0:47:48.90,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,That’s even better
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.69,0:47:52.15,voiceover,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't feel guilty
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.46,0:48:17.30,italics,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.18,0:48:21.64,general text,,0,0,0,,I have a request for you
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.35,0:48:24.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Can you go to the mages wing for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.89,0:48:27.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.14,0:48:30.14,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s cold here. Can you bring me a blanket?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.06,0:48:32.65,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard that they are stored there
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.83,0:48:48.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.18,0:49:09.85,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.93,0:49:12.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Trying to keep the fire going in the brazier
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.00,0:49:32.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Wow
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.92,0:49:34.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.79,0:49:36.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you completely stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.71,0:49:39.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Stop
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.01,0:49:45.80,general text,,0,0,0,,You just called me a fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.89,0:49:47.56,general text,,0,0,0,,There are hundreds of books here
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.64,0:49:49.22,general text,,0,0,0,,You could burn them all
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.31,0:49:51.27,general text,,0,0,0,,I controlled the fire with a spell
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.35,0:49:52.77,general text,,0,0,0,,I cannot use force,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.02,0:49:55.31,general text,,0,0,0,,so confused
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.40,0:49:58.77,general text,,0,0,0,,But you could just cover it with a lid
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.86,0:50:00.57,italics,,0,0,0,,People call you a genius
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.65,0:50:02.57,general text,,0,0,0,,But you lose control in difficult situations
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.65,0:50:05.03,general text,,0,0,0,,- You're just a fool{\i1}\N- Don't insult me
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.11,0:50:06.66,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll be offended
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.49,0:50:10.08,general text,,0,0,0,,So you know how to be offended
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.37,0:50:13.54,general text,,0,0,0,,You are always as calm as water
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.04,0:50:16.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Even water can boil or freeze
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.67,0:50:19.17,italics,,0,0,0,,She doesn't always stay calm
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.43,0:50:29.85,general text,,0,0,0,,It became humid due to the fog
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.93,0:50:32.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you start a fire because your leg hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.85,0:50:37.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you remember this
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.86,0:50:40.02,italics,,0,0,0,,I'm fine
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.11,0:50:41.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.28,0:50:47.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you like pine needle tea
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.66,0:50:51.16,general text,,0,0,0,,But I couldn’t brew it for you
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.20,0:50:53.70,general text,,0,0,0,,You remember this too
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.54,0:50:57.08,general text,,0,0,0,,And what is the point of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.79,0:50:59.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Just remember
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.42,0:51:02.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Brew it next time
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.72,0:51:07.30,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,There won’t be a next time
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.39,0:51:11.51,voiceover,,0,0,0,,If I change body, he will die too
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.60,0:51:12.47,italics,,0,0,0,,Or better
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.56,0:51:14.85,general text,,0,0,0,,teach me
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.93,0:51:17.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Then I’ll brew it myself. Like last time
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.56,0:51:19.86,italics,,0,0,0,,Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.11,0:51:28.24,general text,,0,0,0,,I appreciate
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.12,0:51:31.12,general text,,0,0,0,,all memories from Danhyangok
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.79,0:51:43.75,offscreen,,0,0,0,,So Yul will die
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.63,0:51:51.60,general text,,0,0,0,,I went to the magicians’ wing to get a blanket
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.68,0:51:53.06,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll go
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.15,0:52:04.07,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll go, and you go to Uku
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.58,0:52:15.33,general text,,0,0,0,,He is looking for you everywhere
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.92,0:52:29.63,voiceover,,0,0,0,,I just need to be Nak Soo again
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.89,0:52:33.18,voiceover,,0,0,0,,I already cut off contact with him in the past
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.22,0:52:36.97,voiceover,,0,0,0,,I'll do the same with everyone else
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.24,0:52:53.12,general text,,0,0,0,,The barrier will not break from your gaze
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.71,0:53:00.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.62,0:53:03.21,general text,,0,0,0,,The stone passed through him
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.04,0:53:05.09,general text,,0,0,0,,You are right
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.00,0:53:08.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Perhaps only things made of water cannot pass
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.30,0:53:09.80,italics,,0,0,0,,What a strange barrier
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.88,0:53:12.76,general text,,0,0,0,,He decides what to skip
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.84,0:53:14.30,general text,,0,0,0,,What kind of barrier is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.01,0:53:16.68,general text,,0,0,0,,And what are the others doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.76,0:53:20.52,general text,,0,0,0,,There are so many great magicians there, but they still haven’t been able to break him
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.94,0:53:23.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Is it because the ice stone created it?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.77,0:53:27.61,general text,,0,0,0,,They are probably busy arguing over who gets the stone
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.69,0:53:30.82,general text,,0,0,0,,But they know that I’m locked here
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.45,0:53:37.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you are not that important to the queen who has the ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.66,0:53:40.12,italics,,0,0,0,,How can a mother behave like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.12,0:53:43.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Or does she look like my father?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.21,0:53:46.71,general text,,0,0,0,,That’s right
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.79,0:53:50.46,general text,,0,0,0,,As you know, she is not my real mother
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.55,0:53:53.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Like your father to you
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.64,0:53:57.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Everyone is talking about it
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.97,0:53:59.89,general text,,0,0,0,,I won’t apologize, even if it hurt you
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.60,0:54:02.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Then I won’t beat around the bush either
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.19,0:54:06.90,general text,,0,0,0,,If the queen and Jin Mu offer you the power of the ice stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.98,0:54:08.36,general text,,0,0,0,,can you get rid of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.36,0:54:15.66,general text,,0,0,0,,It will be difficult to refuse such incredible power
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.62,0:54:17.83,general text,,0,0,0,,You are brave
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.33,0:54:21.95,general text,,0,0,0,,It takes courage to openly admit your greed
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.29,0:54:29.80,general text,,0,0,0,,And you? What would you do if you had it?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.30,0:54:35.18,general text,,0,0,0,,I would act like Master So Kyung
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.26,0:54:36.43,general text,,0,0,0,,So Kyung?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.01,0:54:40.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want to become a hero with the destiny of a royal star,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.85,0:54:42.77,general text,,0,0,0,,destroy all the stones and save the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.85,0:54:46.44,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he did it with the best intentions
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.52,0:54:50.86,general text,,0,0,0,,And I believe that he left one stone to save the one he loved
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.48,0:54:53.11,general text,,0,0,0,,also with the best intentions
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.61,0:54:56.07,general text,,0,0,0,,You see, this part resonates with me the most
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.41,0:55:01.91,general text,,0,0,0,,So, this is what he wrote in his book
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.99,0:55:05.29,general text,,0,0,0,,This is just an excuse for not being able to get rid of the stone
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.08,0:55:07.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Who will believe this?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.46,0:55:08.83,general text,,0,0,0,,I believe
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.79,0:55:13.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Because I would do the same
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.02,0:55:32.19,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.27,0:55:34.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Stones pass through the barrier
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.15,0:55:36.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Send them a message so they can save you quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.82,0:55:40.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.12,0:55:43.24,general text,,0,0,0,,You are a genius
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.25,0:55:48.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's see
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.67,0:55:53.84,general text,,0,0,0,,- Barrier{\i1}\N- Hey Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.59,0:55:56.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Is there a bigger stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.51,0:55:58.30,general text,,0,0,0,,They just need to read your message
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.38,0:56:00.09,general text,,0,0,0,,You don't need a big stone
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.18,0:56:01.68,italics,,0,0,0,,Must be written in capital letters
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.39,0:56:04.56,general text,,0,0,0,,This stone cannot be lifted?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.43,0:56:08.69,general text,,0,0,0,,- Let's have a drink\N- Let's have a drink
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.69,0:56:12.27,general text,,0,0,0,,By the way, why Dan Gu never told us
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.36,0:56:14.86,italics,,0,0,0,,about your secret supplies of alcohol?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.94,0:56:17.28,italics,,0,0,0,,We must drink everything here, drink
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.36,0:56:19.78,italics,,0,0,0,,- Let's have a drink\N- Let's have a drink
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.49,0:56:25.87,general text,,0,0,0,,I brought another brazier
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.25,0:56:29.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.04,0:56:31.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.92,0:56:33.00,general text,,0,0,0,,In what sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.00,0:56:37.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr. Yul went to get the blanket himself
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.84,0:56:42.64,memories italics,,0,0,0,,So Yul is also in Jeonjingak
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.72,0:56:44.60,memories,,0,0,0,,I will kill him first
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.09,0:57:17.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr. Yul, you are not allowed to enter there
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.84,0:57:21.18,general text,,0,0,0,,- What happened?\N- Go back
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.89,0:57:25.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Can you see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.89,0:57:27.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.18,0:58:01.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.17,0:58:33.38,italics,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.34,0:58:38.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Sir, what should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.99,0:58:58.15,italics,,0,0,0,,What to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.22,0:59:23.47,italics,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.55,0:59:25.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.29,0:59:55.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Yul!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.79,0:59:56.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Yul!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.09,1:00:05.47,general text,,0,0,0,,- Mister\N- Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.25,1:00:38.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Yul
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.05,1:00:41.84,general text,,0,0,0,,- What happened?{\i1}\N- Nomad
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.92,1:00:43.09,general text,,0,0,0,,There is a nomad here
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.18,1:00:44.43,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.93,1:00:49.26,general text,,0,0,0,,There is a nomad
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.35,1:00:51.98,italics,,0,0,0,,He absorbed the energy of Yoon Soo and Jin Ho
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.62,1:01:10.79,general text,,0,0,0,,The Nomad is the master Kan of Degantongun, he is very strong
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.87,1:01:14.21,general text,,0,0,0,,And he used the energy to cast the spell
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.29,1:01:16.54,general text,,0,0,0,,None of us can use force here
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.21,1:01:18.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Why does he succeed?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.71,1:01:21.09,general text,,0,0,0,,This place absorbs our energy,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.17,1:01:22.63,general text,,0,0,0,,but for them it’s the other way around, apparently
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.59,1:01:27.43,memories italics,,0,0,0,,If I get my power back
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.05,1:01:30.22,memories,,0,0,0,,and run away with the stone?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.89,1:01:33.64,memories,,0,0,0,,If you get caught, you might be killed
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.10,1:01:36.31,memories,,0,0,0,,Aren’t you afraid?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.40,1:01:38.48,memories,,0,0,0,,I'm a little scared
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.56,1:01:41.07,memories,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that you will break our promise
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.15,1:01:42.99,memories,,0,0,0,,and you leave me without even saying goodbye
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.40,1:01:47.70,memories,,0,0,0,,- Chan Wook, I...\N{\i1}- Mister
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.16,1:01:55.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Where is Moo Dok?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.71,1:01:57.50,general text,,0,0,0,,She was here not long ago
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.13,1:01:59.38,italics,,0,0,0,,Where did she go?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.09,1:02:07.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Trouble has appeared
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.44,1:02:20.77,general text,,0,0,0,,If he is not stopped, they will all die
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.82,1:02:25.69,general text,,0,0,0,,They will still die if I change bodies
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.78,1:02:27.70,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s funny to save them now
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.82,1:02:30.70,general text,,0,0,0,,So I will cut off contact with them
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.50,1:02:37.75,general text,,0,0,0,,But I’m still uneasy
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.33,1:02:41.08,general text,,0,0,0,,This will be the last time I save them
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.00,1:02:43.17,general text,,0,0,0,,One more time
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.63,1:02:46.72,general text,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.01,1:02:50.72,general text,,0,0,0,,- Where have you been?\N- I came
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.22,1:02:52.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.93,1:02:54.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook can die!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.58,1:03:17.37,memories italics,,0,0,0,,No one can defeat him now
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.08,1:03:19.71,memories italics,,0,0,0,,We can’t all die
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.79,1:03:22.25,memories italics,,0,0,0,,I'll try to lure him into the secret room
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.92,1:03:28.92,italics,,0,0,0,,When he locks the nomad with him in the secret room,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.01,1:03:30.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk will also die
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.88,1:03:31.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.72,1:03:34.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did he go alone?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.22,1:03:37.60,italics,,0,0,0,,He said he had to
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.68,1:03:39.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Said it was his responsibility
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.48,1:03:49.07,general text,,0,0,0,,- Where are you going?\N- To the secret room
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.45,1:03:52.45,general text,,0,0,0,,If the door in the secret room is open,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.87,1:03:56.41,general text,,0,0,0,,which means Uk died and could not lure him there
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.49,1:03:57.99,italics,,0,0,0,,If the door is closed,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.91,1:04:00.54,italics,,0,0,0,,then he's probably already dead
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.29,1:04:02.50,general text,,0,0,0,,This makes no sense
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.79,1:04:07.67,general text,,0,0,0,,You said you wouldn't try to hold me back
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.63,1:04:10.38,general text,,0,0,0,,You can't stop me
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.38,1:04:12.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Please let me go
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.40,1:05:14.99,memories italics,,0,0,0,,If the door is closed, then he is probably already dead
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.33,1:05:22.87,memories italics,,0,0,0,,But I won’t turn back time, even if I regret something
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.33,1:05:25.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.42,1:08:20.84,general text,,0,0,0,,You are alive,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.01,1:08:24.43,general text,,0,0,0,,my student
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.61,1:08:45.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did you hide this from me?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.49,1:08:50.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Because
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.62,1:08:53.87,general text,,0,0,0,,wanted you to die
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.67,1:08:56.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Then
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.09,1:08:59.38,general text,,0,0,0,,why did you come?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.72,1:09:03.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Because
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.05,1:09:09.56,general text,,0,0,0,,you could have died
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.23,1:09:17.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Since you picked up the sword,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.36,1:09:20.69,general text,,0,0,0,,make your choice
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.65,1:09:25.41,general text,,0,0,0,,I know that you were avoiding me
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.49,1:09:28.12,general text,,0,0,0,,I know that our lives are in your hands
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.54,1:09:33.87,general text,,0,0,0,,As promised,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.96,1:09:36.54,general text,,0,0,0,,point your sword at me first
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.93,1:09:51.97,memories,,0,0,0,,You’ll kill,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.68,1:09:55.27,memories,,0,0,0,,I will become the one who died,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.02,1:09:57.40,memories,,0,0,0,,freeing the mercenary
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.56,1:10:00.86,memories,,0,0,0,,Have mercy -
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.69,1:10:03.69,memories,,0,0,0,,I will make you another promise
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.09,1:10:28.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.68,1:10:34.56,general text,,0,0,0,,as you said,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.14,1:10:37.98,general text,,0,0,0,,give me another promise
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.42,1:11:54.60,preview,,0,0,0,,What kind of person could refuse such incredible power?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.68,1:11:56.97,preview,,0,0,0,,To protect what we must...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.06,1:11:58.47,preview,,0,0,0,,What if I give it my all?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.56,1:12:00.35,preview,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to protect you too
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.10,1:12:02.94,preview,,0,0,0,,What is he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.02,1:12:05.52,preview,,0,0,0,,The incredible divine power of Jin Bu Young
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.61,1:12:07.69,preview,,0,0,0,,she got it not only from her mother, a member of the Jin family
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.78,1:12:11.07,preview,,0,0,0,,Park Jin! You hid the truth, knowing everything perfectly well
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.99,1:12:17.49,preview,,0,0,0,,And now those who must leave will leave, and those who must return will return
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.58,1:12:20.16,preview,,0,0,0,,Sir, do what you think is necessary
